  "claim": "The 52nd Berlin International Film Festival opened with the Tom Tykwer horror movie that starred Catherine Elise Blanchett, an Australian actress who portrayed Katharine Hepburn in the 2004 film \"The Aviator\".",
  "evidencia": "Page: Heaven (2002 film). Sentence: Heaven is a 2002 romantic thriller film directed by Tom Tykwer, starring Cate Blanchett and Giovanni Ribisi.\nPage: Cate Blanchett. Sentence: Catherine Elise Blanchett, {'1': \", '2': \", '3': \", '4': \"} ( ; born 14 May 1969) is an Australian actress and theatre director.\nPage: Cate Blanchett. Sentence: Her portrayal of Katharine Hepburn in Martin Scorsese's 2004 film \"The Aviator\" brought her critical acclaim and many accolades, including the Academy Award for Best Actress in a Supporting Role, making her the only actor to win an Oscar for portraying another Oscar-winning actor.\nPage: 52nd Berlin International Film Festival. Sentence: The festival opened with \"Heaven\" by Tom Tykwer.",
