        "original_id": "c6f02713-ba64-5acf-bedd-28cb4157ee78",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cate Blanchett, Tom Tykwer, Giovanni Ribisi, Katharine Hepburn, Martin Scorsese\n- Films: Heaven, The Aviator\n- Events: 52nd Berlin International Film Festival\n- Roles: actress, theatre director\n- Topics: Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Heaven is a 2002 romantic thriller film directed by Tom Tykwer and starring Cate Blanchett and Giovanni Ribisi.\n- The 52nd Berlin International Film Festival opened with Heaven by Tom Tykwer.\n- Cate Blanchett was born on 14 May 1969 and is an Australian actress and theatre director.\n- Cate Blanchett portrayed Katharine Hepburn in Martin Scorsese's 2004 film The Aviator.\n- Cate Blanchett's performance in The Aviator brought her critical acclaim and many accolades, including the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actress.\n- Cate Blanchett became the only actor to win an Oscar for portraying another Oscar-winning actor through her portrayal of Katharine Hepburn in The Aviator.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
